| DAMAGE - Personal Greeter

@print+
     +What's your name?-
@-

@user,print+
     + -
@var:create+name-
@-

@print,var+
     +Hey (name)! Nice to meet you.-
@-

@print+
     +How old are you?-
@-

@user,print+
     + -
@var:create+age-
@-

@print,var+
if, (age) < 18
     @+Still a kid huh, (name)!-
if, (age) = 18
     @+Just turned adult, welcome (name)!-
if, (age) > 18
     @+(name), you're an adult. Congrats on surviving this long.-
@-
